# Credential files. Only the *.example templates are committed — those carry
# placeholders a deploy script refuses to accept (`<change-me>`, `<AKIA...>`).
# Verified against the full history 2026-08-07: no real credential file has ever
# been committed, and every AKIA / PRIVATE KEY string in it is a placeholder, a
# test fixture, or the redaction regex in src/lib/error-bridge.ts. These rules
# are what keeps that true in a public repository, where a single `git add k8s/`
# would be irreversible — a pushed secret stays in forks and caches after any
# history rewrite, so it has to be rotated, not deleted.
.env
.env.local
.env.production
.env.*.local
k8s/console/*-secrets.yaml
**/console-secrets.yaml
tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
*.tsbuildinfo
next-env.d.ts
.vitest/
playwright-report/
test-results/
.console-data/
# Monaco's AMD build, copied out of node_modules by scripts/copy-monaco.mjs.
# Derived from the pinned monaco-editor dependency, not source.
public/monaco/
